 bikeclub.net/cue/dh-donegal-loop-ride-17r/](https://routes.lancasterbikecl
 ub.net/cue/dh-donegal-loop-ride-17r/)\nRoute 2 from Donegal HS at approx. 
 10:30am: [https://routes.lancasterbikeclub.net/cue/ep-landisville-casual-r
 ide-22f/](https://routes.lancasterbikeclub.net/cue/ep-landisville-casual-r
 ide-22f/)\nPlease RSVP or we will not wait for you.\n\nFood or Ice Cream b
 ased on the group's preference after the ride.\n\nThis is intended to be a
  group ride with a no-drop rule as the main goal. The ride leader will do 
 his/her best to keep the group together with occasional regroupings and a 
 sweeper may also be appointed at the start.\n\nHelmets are mandatory. No e
 arbuds. Please bring water and a basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire lever
 s\, pump/CO2 inflator).\n\nTo eliminate passing around a pen and paper wai
 ver\, we require LBC Club membership and Meetup RSVP below to join this ri
 de. Being on Meetup does not mean you are a club member.\n\nJoin here [Mem
 ber Signup](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&club
 _id=257148)\nYour RSVP is your agreement to abide by the club's Code of Co
 nduct: [Code of Conduct](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?pa
